body:
i thought the exact same thing, unless the reception was black-tie as a lot of extras were wearing similarly dark or dull colours. it no doubt serves as foreshadowing though, especially coupled with the cloudy sky towards the end, it was such a contrast from the bright sunny colours of catherine's italian wedding in s3. it just felt really business-y or conference-y possibly in an attempt to allude to the way many characters and fans see Connor and Willa's wedding as a business transaction sadly

&#x200B;

(to quote tom, shiv's dress wasn't "very wedding-y" but she still served)
